WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:06.590 line:85%
Two brown trout rested side by side
in the shade of the bank trees,

2
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:10.100 line:85%
the first flash of silver in Cell 7’s water.

3
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.570 line:85%
Far to the east, Ember’s radio had gone quiet,

4
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.600 line:85%
resting to save power.

5
00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:17.780 line:85%
Maris left the channel open.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.980 line:85%
Downwind, Mistral keeps the wet route,

7
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.210 line:85%
a trail of water that kingfishers and otters
follow from island to island,

8
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.180 line:85%
one snack stop at a time.

9
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.730 line:85%
Cell 7 was on her chart now.
But only in pencil.

10
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.380 line:85%
And pencil rubs out.
